|---|---|---|---|
| `stoogebag` (base) | `UNITASK`, `UNIRX` | UniTask, UniRx, DOTween, `DOTween.Modules`, `UniTask.DOTween`, `UniTask.TextMeshPro`, TextMeshPro, URP Core, Input System, `stoogebag.ManagedUpdate.Runtime` | Odin/Sirenix, SALSA, Behavior Designer, DOTween Pro (precompiled DLL refs) |
| `stoogebag.ManagedUpdate.Runtime` | — | — | — |
| `stoogebag.editor` | — (Editor-only) | UnityEditor.UI, TextMeshPro | — |
| `stoogebag.audio` | — | FMOD, Addressables, UniTask, UniRx, DOTween | — |
| `stoogebag.audio.editor` | — (Editor-only) | stoogebag | — |
| `stoogebag.AI` | `BEHAVIOR_DESIGNER` | — | Behavior Designer |
| `stoogebag.cinemachine` | `CINEMACHINE` | Cinemachine (v2 `Cinemachine` + v3 `Unity.Cinemachine`) | — |
| `stoogebag.dialogue` | `TIMELINE` | Timeline, UniTask, UniRx, TMP, Cinemachine, Whisper, Text Animator (Runtime + ForUnity), stoogebag.UI, interaction, textanimator | Adventure Creator, VIDE, Whisper, Text Animator, Ultimate Editor Enhancer (code-gated) |
| `stoogebag.dialogue.editor` | `TIMELINE` (Editor-only) | Timeline + Timeline.Editor | — |
| `stoogebag.feel` | `FEEL` | — | More Mountains Feel |
| `stoogebag.interaction` | — | stoogebag, cinemachine, UI, UniTask, UniRx, `UniTask.DOTween` | — |
| `stoogebag.networking` | `FISHNET` | FishNet (`FishNet.Runtime`, `FishyUnityTransport`), UniRx, Input System, stoogebag.UI | — |
| `stoogebag.portals` | `PORTALS` | URP Universal Runtime, interaction, stoogebag | — |
| `stoogebag.puzzgrid` | `PUZZGRID`, `UNITASK`, `UNIRX`, `UNITASK_DOTWEEN_SUPPORT` | UniTask, UniRx, Input System, portals, DOTween, `UniTask.DOTween` | — |
| `stoogebag.salsa` | `SALSA` | UniRx | SALSA (Crazy Minnow) + RootMotion |
