| `stoogebag.textanimator` | — | Text Animator (Runtime + ForUnity), UniTask | Febucci Text Animator |
| `stoogebag.timeflow` | `TIMEFLOW` | — | Timeflow (Axon Genesis) |
| `stoogebag.Timeline` | `TIMELINE` | Timeline, UniRx, Splines, TMP, UniTask, Text Animator, stoogebag, tweening, dialogue | DOTween Pro (`DOTweenPro.Scripts`) |
| `stoogebag.timeline.editor` | `TIMELINE` (Editor-only) | Timeline + Timeline.Editor | — |
| `stoogebag.tweening` | — | UniTask, `UniTask.DOTween` | DOTween Pro |
| `stoogebag.UI` | — | UniRx, UniTask, TMP, Cinemachine, `UniTask.DOTween`, DOTween, Input System, stoogebag | — |

## Feature-gated extras

Only needed if you enable the matching `#define`.

| Type | Items |
|---|---|
| UPM packages | Splines, FishNet (git), Whisper (git) |
| Asset Store / third-party | Odin Inspector, Behavior Designer, Feel, Timeflow, Adventure Creator, AniMancer, OneJS, Broccoli, Dreamteck Splines, UI Shapes Kit, UI Extensions, Ultimate Editor Enhancer |
| Global define symbols | `UNITASK`, `UNIRX`, `UNITASK_DOTWEEN_SUPPORT`, `DOTWEEN`, `ODIN_INSPECTOR`, `CINEMACHINE`, `NEW_CINEMACHINE`, `TIMELINE`, `SPLINES`, `PUZZGRID`, `PORTALS`, `FISHNET`, `BEHAVIOR_DESIGNER`, `FEEL`, `SALSA`, `TIMEFLOW`, `TEXT_ANIMATOR`, `WHISPER`, `VIDE`, `ADVENTURE_CREATOR`, `INCONTROL_EXISTS`, `ANIMANCER`, `ONE_JS`, `BROCCOLI`, `DREAMTECK_SPLINES`, `UI_EXTENSIONS`, `UI_SHAPES_KIT`, `ULTIMATE_EDITOR_ENHANCER` |
